{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 15896584476470319808,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "I/O Bandwidth: Measurement and Optimization",
      "source_hash": 16929464427665636794,
      "context_hash": 15436199781444997021,
      "translation": "I/O 대역폭: 측정과 최적화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658118Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How to measure actual I/O bandwidth, where the limits come from, and how to approach them",
      "source_hash": 1903291831242548721,
      "context_hash": 836278365993732098,
      "translation": "실제 I/O 대역폭을 측정하는 방법, 한계가 생기는 원인, 그리고 한계에 근접하는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658119Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What limits I/O bandwidth?",
      "source_hash": 9773619004966643015,
      "context_hash": 8376388349928897594,
      "translation": "I/O 대역폭을 제한하는 요인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658119Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "I/O bandwidth — bytes per second moving between storage and memory — is bounded by the weakest link in the chain:",
      "source_hash": 18377252332561758403,
      "context_hash": 567512402841316532,
      "translation": "I/O 대역폭, 즉 스토리지와 메모리 사이를 이동하는 초당 바이트 수는 경로상의 가장 약한 고리에 의해 제한됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "bytes": "바이트",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658119Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "In practice, the limit is often not the hardware interface but the software path: CPU overhead, queue serialization, filesystem overhead, or the memory subsystem's ability to supply data fast enough.",
      "source_hash": 16180908783619821578,
      "context_hash": 865027376663280625,
      "translation": "실제로는 하드웨어 인터페이스보다 소프트웨어 경로가 한계가 되는 경우가 많습니다. CPU 오버헤드, 큐 직렬화, 파일 시스템 오버헤드, 또는 메모리 서브시스템이 데이터를 충분히 빠르게 공급하는 능력이 그 원인입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "overhead": "오버헤드",
        "queue": "큐",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658119Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Measuring device bandwidth",
      "source_hash": 10743157655142247189,
      "context_hash": 2242649208508636531,
      "translation": "디바이스 대역폭 측정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:36.307021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`fio`: the authoritative benchmark",
      "source_hash": 5787410479175891551,
      "context_hash": 12800404354834164321,
      "translation": "`fio`: 신뢰할 수 있는 표준 벤치마크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Why `bs=1M` and `iodepth=32`?** Sequential bandwidth is maximized with large I/O sizes (the device can serve a 1MB request in one operation) and sufficient queue depth to keep the device busy while the previous I/O completes.",
      "source_hash": 17100588877155971176,
      "context_hash": 11750830797764696162,
      "translation": "**왜 `bs=1M`과 `iodepth=32`인가?** 순차 대역폭은 큰 I/O 크기(디바이스가 1MB 요청을 한 번의 연산으로 처리할 수 있음)와, 이전 I/O가 완료되는 동안에도 디바이스를 계속 바쁘게 유지할 수 있는 충분한 큐 깊이에서 최대가 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "queue depth": "큐 깊이"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:36.307029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`dd`: quick sequential measurement",
      "source_hash": 13948186971240062735,
      "context_hash": 15362242260966939501,
      "translation": "`dd`: 빠른 순차 측정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`dd` is not a reliable benchmark (single-threaded, no queue depth control), but it is fast and available everywhere.",
      "source_hash": 1388209195645144538,
      "context_hash": 3216779000286609658,
      "translation": "`dd`는 신뢰할 수 있는 벤치마크가 아니지만(단일 스레드이며 큐 깊이를 제어할 수 없음), 빠르고 어디서나 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue depth": "큐 깊이"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`/proc/diskstats` for live throughput",
      "source_hash": 6387858772197272256,
      "context_hash": 16874636454796813709,
      "translation": "실시간 처리량 확인을 위한 `/proc/diskstats`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "throughput": "처리량"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The CPU bottleneck in I/O bandwidth",
      "source_hash": 14256717804387465698,
      "context_hash": 17786426759300403263,
      "translation": "I/O 대역폭의 CPU 병목",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On modern NVMe devices (5–7 GB/s), the storage device is often not the bottleneck — the CPU is.",
      "source_hash": 18444346048782532946,
      "context_hash": 8570507734653120001,
      "translation": "최신 NVMe 디바이스(5–7 GB/s)에서는 스토리지 디바이스가 병목이 아닌 경우가 많으며, 병목은 CPU입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "devices": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:36.307030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Moving data between the device and memory requires:",
      "source_hash": 4739311974030883054,
      "context_hash": 8540381893951751829,
      "translation": "디바이스와 메모리 사이에서 데이터를 옮기려면 다음이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:36.307031Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Interrupt handling**: one interrupt per I/O completion (or per-batch with interrupt coalescing)",
      "source_hash": 13804668249424651500,
      "context_hash": 17025825742489586170,
      "translation": "**인터럽트 처리**: I/O 완료마다 인터럽트 1회(또는 인터럽트 병합(interrupt coalescing) 사용 시 배치마다 1회)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Memory copy**: if data passes through the kernel buffer before reaching userspace",
      "source_hash": 8802635170436931876,
      "context_hash": 6761452539628364217,
      "translation": "**메모리 복사**: 데이터가 사용자 공간에 도달하기 전에 커널 버퍼를 거치는 경우",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**DMA management**: programming the IOMMU, pinning pages, checking completion",
      "source_hash": 14413342762632825972,
      "context_hash": 11325631321578400214,
      "translation": "**DMA 관리**: IOMMU 프로그래밍, 페이지 고정(pinning), 완료 확인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "IOMMU": "IOMMU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**CPU-limited bandwidth symptoms:**",
      "source_hash": 2211085515493630914,
      "context_hash": 2880109224293433501,
      "translation": "**CPU 제한 대역폭의 증상:**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`iostat %util` < 100% but bandwidth plateau at ~3–4 GB/s",
      "source_hash": 4996158479893077527,
      "context_hash": 17461348777233691267,
      "translation": "`iostat %util`이 < 100%인데도 대역폭이 ~3–4 GB/s에서 정체됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "One CPU core at 100% (`mpstat` shows high `%irq` or `%soft`)",
      "source_hash": 18185886134244673291,
      "context_hash": 12852657748622109764,
      "translation": "CPU 코어 하나가 100% 사용률(`mpstat`에서 높은 `%irq` 또는 `%soft` 표시)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Throughput increases linearly with the number of parallel jobs (up to CPU saturation)",
      "source_hash": 11940271948490001907,
      "context_hash": 9314229214284719146,
      "translation": "병렬 작업 수에 비례해 처리량이 선형적으로 증가(CPU 포화 시점까지)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "throughput": "처리량"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "**Solutions:**",
      "source_hash": 9273168883185350879,
      "context_hash": 12645820800489904586,
      "translation": "**해결 방법:**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "**Solutions**:": "**해결 방법**"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Queue depth and parallelism",
      "source_hash": 4123959982947213452,
      "context_hash": 3395224156287176264,
      "translation": "큐 깊이와 병렬성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue depth": "큐 깊이"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For sequential I/O, bandwidth scales with queue depth — up to the device's internal parallelism limit:",
      "source_hash": 8572339395250448228,
      "context_hash": 3512811173588439271,
      "translation": "순차 I/O에서 대역폭은 디바이스의 내부 병렬성 한계까지 큐 깊이에 비례하여 증가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "queue depth": "큐 깊이"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:36.307034Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Typical NVMe bandwidth vs queue depth curve:",
      "source_hash": 10169230762895623231,
      "context_hash": 1396185260760332073,
      "translation": "일반적인 NVMe 대역폭 대 큐 깊이 곡선:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "queue depth": "큐 깊이"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The relationship is: `IOPS = queue_depth / latency`; multiply by block size for throughput.",
      "source_hash": 11254650704937428469,
      "context_hash": 8927028247731482248,
      "translation": "관계식은 `IOPS = queue_depth / latency`이며, 여기에 블록 크기를 곱하면 처리량이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "throughput": "처리량"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "If latency is 100µs (0.1ms), a queue depth of 1 achieves 10,000 IOPS = 40 MB/s at 4KB.",
      "source_hash": 14506144247260879256,
      "context_hash": 7110633152790864539,
      "translation": "지연 시간이 100µs(0.1ms)라면 큐 깊이 1에서 10,000 IOPS, 즉 4KB 기준 40 MB/s를 달성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IOPS": "IOPS",
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "queue depth": "큐 깊이"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "At queue depth 32: 320,000 IOPS = 1.25 GB/s at 4KB.",
      "source_hash": 10786229118336786575,
      "context_hash": 345286038617355590,
      "translation": "큐 깊이 32에서는 320,000 IOPS, 즉 4KB 기준 1.25 GB/s입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IOPS": "IOPS",
        "queue depth": "큐 깊이"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Memory bandwidth as a ceiling",
      "source_hash": 2231927204908492085,
      "context_hash": 4623783624373772740,
      "translation": "상한으로서의 메모리 대역폭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For large sequential I/O, data must move between the device and DRAM.",
      "source_hash": 473462061516419510,
      "context_hash": 11848126225740004798,
      "translation": "큰 순차 I/O에서는 데이터가 디바이스와 DRAM 사이를 이동해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DRAM": "DRAM",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:36.307034Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The DRAM bandwidth imposes an absolute ceiling:",
      "source_hash": 14709459495977454245,
      "context_hash": 3747761119955701238,
      "translation": "DRAM 대역폭은 절대적인 상한을 부과합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DRAM": "DRAM",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:45.658122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When building high-bandwidth storage systems (NVMe-oF, large RAID arrays), DRAM bandwidth becomes the limiting factor.",
      "source_hash": 13134214192655835173,
      "context_hash": 11984597583986030174,
      "translation": "고대역폭 스토리지 시스템(NVMe-oF, 대규모 RAID 배열)을 구축할 때는 DRAM 대역폭이 제한 요인이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DRAM": "DRAM",
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "arrays": "배열",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:36.307036Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Solutions include:",
      "source_hash": 904519004782573688,
      "context_hash": 6304168832367744418,
      "translation": "해결 방법은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375846Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**NUMA-aware I/O**: keep I/O buffers in the same NUMA node as the device",
      "source_hash": 17023905017519971158,
      "context_hash": 7011172523131446808,
      "translation": "**NUMA 인식 I/O**: I/O 버퍼를 디바이스와 같은 NUMA 노드에 둡니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NUMA": "NUMA",
        "NUMA node": "NUMA 노드",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375847Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**DMA directly to PMEM**: bypass DRAM for persistent memory destinations",
      "source_hash": 4983571064526113101,
      "context_hash": 5990496005248539283,
      "translation": "**PMEM으로의 직접 DMA**: 영구 메모리(persistent memory)가 대상인 경우 DRAM을 우회합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "DRAM": "DRAM",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375847Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Kernel bypass**: SPDK (Storage Performance Development Kit) avoids kernel overhead entirely",
      "source_hash": 4211024450246610659,
      "context_hash": 10159199502369265173,
      "translation": "**커널 우회**: SPDK(Storage Performance Development Kit)는 커널 오버헤드를 완전히 피합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375848Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Filesystem overhead on bandwidth",
      "source_hash": 3038436474370628662,
      "context_hash": 16603262853004553593,
      "translation": "파일시스템이 대역폭에 주는 오버헤드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375848Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A raw block device delivers its rated bandwidth.",
      "source_hash": 8730929774955833449,
      "context_hash": 12053151876593388648,
      "translation": "raw 블록 디바이스는 정격 대역폭을 그대로 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "block device": "블록 디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A filesystem on top adds overhead:",
      "source_hash": 6523261005208899777,
      "context_hash": 14640794360009972464,
      "translation": "그 위에 파일시스템을 올리면 오버헤드가 더해집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Typical filesystem overhead for sequential I/O with `O_DIRECT`:",
      "source_hash": 7256616951095944685,
      "context_hash": 2123079757185875866,
      "translation": "`O_DIRECT`를 사용한 순차 I/O에서 일반적인 파일시스템 오버헤드는 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**ext4, XFS**: 3–8% overhead (extent lookup, inode lock)",
      "source_hash": 13638750114481829459,
      "context_hash": 1521525752419656412,
      "translation": "**ext4, XFS**: 3–8% 오버헤드(extent 조회, inode 락)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS",
        "inode": "inode",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Btrfs**: 5–15% overhead (tree operations, checksums)",
      "source_hash": 6564169294389776450,
      "context_hash": 14243844533185806768,
      "translation": "**Btrfs**: 5–15% 오버헤드(트리 연산, 체크섬)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "btrfs": "btrfs",
        "checksums": "체크섬",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**tmpfs**: 0% (memory-backed, no device I/O)",
      "source_hash": 548149677655061417,
      "context_hash": 22519449823186388,
      "translation": "**tmpfs**: 0%(메모리 기반, 디바이스 I/O 없음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "tmpfs": "tmpfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "For buffered I/O (through page cache), the page cache adds a copy but also enables readahead and caching, which can deliver higher bandwidth than the device for re-read workloads.",
      "source_hash": 3592590605056889282,
      "context_hash": 15735710126428864080,
      "translation": "버퍼드 I/O(페이지 캐시 경유)의 경우 페이지 캐시가 복사를 한 번 추가하지만 readahead와 캐싱도 가능하게 하므로, 다시 읽는 워크로드에서는 디바이스보다 높은 대역폭을 낼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "page cache": "페이지 캐시",
        "workloads": "워크로드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:10:41.375850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
